{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a robotic beetle and destroy all of the insects in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy ants with a wide range of abilities and barrage your way to the largest score. As a mechanized beetle, you shoot with your weapon to move from the recoil it has. Scavenge for better abilities to become the one true insect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 abilities that you can pick up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the largest score as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The OST for Beetle Barrage can be found on most streaming platforms, YouTube, Bandcamp, and SoundCloud under the artist: I Have No Mouth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396930/extras/image.png?t=1741966341\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396930?t=1741966341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396930/0c2791524b325c2dbfa582abbc735a46318f7c9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741966341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396930/5bb8e99be598b7ed713f0cdce9ff5d264a6ff865/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741966341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396930/5bb8e99be598b7ed713f0cdce9ff5d264a6ff865/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741966341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A